# ------------------------------
# Cloudflare Tunnel (optional)
# ------------------------------
# Cloudflare Tunnel (cloudflared) token for exposing the app on the internet.
# Get the token from the Cloudflare Zero Trust dashboard when creating a managed tunnel.
# The cloudflared service starts with `docker compose up -d`; without a token it
# exits and stays stopped. Set the token to bring the tunnel up.
CLOUDFLARE_TUNNEL_TOKEN=
